---

## ✨ Overview

**Mediora** is a Virtual Medical Journal and Assistant designed to bring personal healthcare information into one organized digital space.

Managing medical information across prescriptions, reports, symptoms, medications and appointments can become overwhelming. Mediora aims to simplify this experience by providing a centralized platform where users can record, organize and review their health information.

With a clean interface, structured health records and an AI-assistant concept, Mediora focuses on making personal health management more accessible, organized and convenient.

> Your health deserves more than scattered notes and forgotten records. It deserves a space of its own.

---

## 🚀 Features

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| 🔐 User Authentication | Secure account registration and login using Supabase Auth. |
| 📔 Digital Health Journal | Record symptoms, severity and personal health notes. |
| 💊 Medication Manager | Maintain medication details, dosage and frequency. |
| ❤️ Vitals Tracker | Record and organize personal health measurements. |
| 📂 Medical Documents | Maintain organized medical document information and metadata. |
| ⏰ Reminder Manager | Create, manage and track health-related reminders. |
| 🤖 AI Assistant Interface | A conversational interface designed for contextual health assistance. |
| 📊 Dashboard | Access health information and module summaries from one place. |

---

## 🎨 The Experience

Mediora is designed around three principles:

- **Clarity:** Keep important health information structured and easy to find.
- **Accessibility:** Make everyday health record management simple.
- **Continuity:** Maintain a longitudinal record of personal health information.

The interface uses a minimal, calming visual language to make healthcare management feel less overwhelming.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Next.js | Frontend framework and application routing |
| React | Component-based user interface |
| TypeScript | Type-safe development |
| Tailwind CSS | Styling and responsive layouts |
| Supabase | Backend database and authentication |
| PostgreSQL | Relational data storage |
| Vercel | Deployment and hosting |
| Git & GitHub | Version control and source management |

---

## 🏗️ System Architecture

Mediora follows a client-server approach, separating the user interface from authentication and persistent data storage.

```text
             ┌──────────────────────┐
             │       USER           │
             └──────────┬───────────┘
                        │
                        ▼
             ┌──────────────────────┐
             │    NEXT.JS FRONTEND  │
             │                      │
             │  Dashboard           │
             │  Health Journal      │
             │  Medications         │
             │  Vitals              │
             │  Documents           │
             │  Reminders           │
             │  AI Assistant UI     │
             └──────────┬───────────┘
                        │
                        ▼
             ┌──────────────────────┐
             │       SUPABASE       │
             │                      │
             │  Authentication     │
             │  PostgreSQL Database│
             │  Row Level Security │
             └──────────────────────┘
```

